{
  "info": {
    "name": "SMC Trade License - Renewal (TL_RENEW) - Local",
    "description": "Renewal of a Permanent trade license (service `TL_RENEW`) against the local stack (see LOCAL_RUN.md and ../README.md, section 5).\n\n**Before the first run**\n1. Set the collection variable `licenseNumber` to an issued (APPROVED) Permanent license of pg.smc.\n2. Run folder 0: both requests must pass. If not, load the workflow `TL_RENEW` and `billingslab_TL_SMC_Annexure1_renewal.sql`.\n\n**Run** folder 1 top to bottom, or with the Collection Runner. A license can be renewed once per financial year, so for the next run change `licenseNumber`.\n\nThe request bodies are built in the collection pre-request script, driven by the `X-TL-*` headers of each request; the body that was sent is in the Postman console.\n- `X-TL-Renew`: search the license `{{licenseNumber}}` and turn it into the renewal request (applicationType RENEWAL, workflowCode TL_RENEW, action INITIATE)\n- `X-TL-Action` / `X-TL-From`: read the renewal application, wait for the status in `X-TL-From`, send it back with this action\n- `X-TL-User`: `citizen` or `tlsu1` (the real employee TLSU1, given the role in `X-TL-Role` for the step)\n- `X-TL-Expect`: status the test expects; `X-TL-ExpectError`: error code the test expects\n\nThere is no gateway locally: `authToken` is not checked and `userInfo` is sent in the body.\nThe database is shared with the deployed environment: folder 1 creates a real application, demand and receipt. Folder 2 saves nothing.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Check the setup (read only)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Workflow TL_RENEW is loaded",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "tlsu1",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-ExpectCount",
                "value": "1",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"RequestInfo\": {{requestInfo}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{workflowUrl}}/egov-workflow-v2/egov-wf/businessservice/_search?tenantId={{stateTenantId}}&businessServices=TL_RENEW",
              "host": [
                "{{workflowUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "egov-workflow-v2",
                "egov-wf",
                "businessservice",
                "_search"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "tenantId",
                  "value": "{{stateTenantId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "businessServices",
                  "value": "TL_RENEW"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Must return the business service TL_RENEW. Empty: load src/main/resources/Workflows/TL_RENEW.json for tenant pg."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Renewal billing slabs are loaded",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "tlsu1",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-ExpectCount",
                "value": "52",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"RequestInfo\": {{requestInfo}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{calculatorUrl}}/tl-calculator/billingslab/_search?tenantId={{tenantId}}&applicationType=RENEWAL&licenseType=PERMANENT",
              "host": [
                "{{calculatorUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tl-calculator",
                "billingslab",
                "_search"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "tenantId",
                  "value": "{{tenantId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "applicationType",
                  "value": "RENEWAL"
                },
                {
                  "key": "licenseType",
                  "value": "PERMANENT"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Must return the 52 RENEWAL slabs. Fewer: run billingslab_TL_SMC_Annexure1_renewal.sql."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "License to renew",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "citizen",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"RequestInfo\": {{requestInfo}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{tlUrl}}/tl-services/v1/_search?tenantId={{tenantId}}&licenseNumbers={{licenseNumber}}",
              "host": [
                "{{tlUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tl-services",
                "v1",
                "_search"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "tenantId",
                  "value": "{{tenantId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "licenseNumbers",
                  "value": "{{licenseNumber}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "All applications under the license number: the new license and its renewals."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Renewal - citizen applies, TLSU1 processes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "INITIATE the renewal",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Renew",
                "value": "true",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "citizen",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Save",
                "value": "application",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Expect",
                "value": "INITIATED",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-ExpectRenewal",
                "value": "true",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{updateBody}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{tlUrl}}/tl-services/v1/_update",
              "host": [
                "{{tlUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tl-services",
                "v1",
                "_update"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sends the issued license to _update with applicationType RENEWAL, workflowCode TL_RENEW and action INITIATE, as the UI does. tl-services creates a new application under the same license number and sets the financial year: the next one while the license is valid, the current one when it has lapsed. The response carries the fee estimate (TL_RENEWAL_TAX, and TL_RENEWAL_PENALTY when late)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search the renewal",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-WaitStatus",
                "value": "INITIATED",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "citizen",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"RequestInfo\": {{requestInfo}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{tlUrl}}/tl-services/v1/_search?tenantId={{tenantId}}&applicationNumber={{applicationNumber}}",
              "host": [
                "{{tlUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tl-services",
                "v1",
                "_search"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "tenantId",
                  "value": "{{tenantId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "applicationNumber",
                  "value": "{{applicationNumber}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Reads the renewal back. additionalDetail.previousApplicationNumber points to the application it renews."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "APPLY",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Action",
                "value": "APPLY",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-From",
                "value": "INITIATED",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Expect",
                "value": "APPLIED",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "citizen",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{updateBody}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{tlUrl}}/tl-services/v1/_update",
              "host": [
                "{{tlUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tl-services",
                "v1",
                "_update"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Submits the renewal. Adds the missing renewal documents (AADHAARCARD, SHOPACTLICENSE, PREVIOUSLICENSE). The SMC checks run here, including property tax and water dues."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "FORWARD: document verification",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Action",
                "value": "FORWARD",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-From",
                "value": "APPLIED",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Expect",
                "value": "FIELDINSPECTION",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "tlsu1",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Role",
                "value": "TL_DOC_VERIFIER",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{updateBody}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{tlUrl}}/tl-services/v1/_update",
              "host": [
                "{{tlUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tl-services",
                "v1",
                "_update"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Needs role TL_DOC_VERIFIER."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "FORWARD: field inspection",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Action",
                "value": "FORWARD",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-From",
                "value": "FIELDINSPECTION",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Expect",
                "value": "PENDINGHODVERIFICATION",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "tlsu1",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Role",
                "value": "TL_FIELD_INSPECTOR",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{updateBody}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{tlUrl}}/tl-services/v1/_update",
              "host": [
                "{{tlUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tl-services",
                "v1",
                "_update"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Needs role TL_FIELD_INSPECTOR."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "FORWARD: HOD verification",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Action",
                "value": "FORWARD",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-From",
                "value": "PENDINGHODVERIFICATION",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Expect",
                "value": "PENDINGAPPROVAL",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "tlsu1",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Role",
                "value": "TL_HOD",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{updateBody}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{tlUrl}}/tl-services/v1/_update",
              "host": [
                "{{tlUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tl-services",
                "v1",
                "_update"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Needs role TL_HOD."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "APPROVE",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Action",
                "value": "APPROVE",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-From",
                "value": "PENDINGAPPROVAL",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Expect",
                "value": "PENDINGPAYMENT",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "tlsu1",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Role",
                "value": "TL_APPROVER",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{updateBody}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{tlUrl}}/tl-services/v1/_update",
              "host": [
                "{{tlUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tl-services",
                "v1",
                "_update"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Needs role TL_APPROVER (Chief Officer). The demand (LOI) is raised here."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Fetch bill",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-WaitStatus",
                "value": "PENDINGPAYMENT",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "tlsu1",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Role",
                "value": "TL_CEMP",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"RequestInfo\": {{requestInfo}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{billingUrl}}/billing-service/bill/v2/_fetchbill?tenantId={{tenantId}}&consumerCode={{applicationNumber}}&businessService=TL",
              "host": [
                "{{billingUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "billing-service",
                "bill",
                "v2",
                "_fetchbill"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "tenantId",
                  "value": "{{tenantId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "consumerCode",
                  "value": "{{applicationNumber}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "businessService",
                  "value": "TL"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Generates the bill. Heads: TL_RENEWAL_TAX (Annexure 1 fee) and TL_RENEWAL_PENALTY (the same amount again when the renewal was applied for after 31 March, otherwise 0)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Pay in cash",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "tlsu1",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Role",
                "value": "TL_CEMP",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"RequestInfo\": {{requestInfo}},\n  \"Payment\": {\n    \"tenantId\": \"{{tenantId}}\",\n    \"paymentMode\": \"CASH\",\n    \"totalDue\": {{billAmount}},\n    \"totalAmountPaid\": {{billAmount}},\n    \"paidBy\": \"OWNER\",\n    \"payerName\": \"OWNER\",\n    \"mobileNumber\": \"{{citizenMobile}}\",\n    \"paymentDetails\": [\n      {\n        \"businessService\": \"TL\",\n        \"billId\": \"{{billId}}\",\n        \"totalDue\": {{billAmount}},\n        \"totalAmountPaid\": {{billAmount}}\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{collectionUrl}}/collection-services/payments/_create",
              "host": [
                "{{collectionUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "collection-services",
                "payments",
                "_create"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Counter payment of the full bill amount. collection-services publishes the payment event; tl-services then issues the renewal."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search: renewed license",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-WaitStatus",
                "value": "APPROVED",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-User",
                "value": "citizen",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-Expect",
                "value": "APPROVED",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-TL-ExpectRenewal",
                "value": "true",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"RequestInfo\": {{requestInfo}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{tlUrl}}/tl-services/v1/_search?tenantId={{tenantId}}&applicationNumber={{applicationNumber}}",
              "host": [
                "{{tlUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tl-services",
                "v1",
                "_search"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "tenantId",
                  "value": "{{tenantId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "applicationNumber",
                  "value": "{{applicationNumber}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "The renewal is APPROVED with the same license number and the new validity."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Refused renewals (nothing is saved)",
      "item": [
