              "path": [
                "tl-services",
                "v1",
                "_update"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The fee is that of the business type on the previous license, so it cannot change in a renewal. After folder 1 has renewed {{licenseNumber}} for the last financial year in MDMS, this request is refused earlier with INVALID FINANCIALYEAR instead; use another licenseNumber."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
